{"v":4,"catch":"走開！","desc":"歡迎來到《林間小徑》（Woodland Trail），這是一款輕鬆愜意的步行模擬遊戲，在這裡，沿途的風景與最終的目的地同樣重要。\n\n探索這片寧靜的林地，這裡有隱密的小徑、幽靜的角落以及等待被發現的各種甜瓜。放慢腳步，隨心所欲漫步，看看你能否集齊所有的甜瓜。\n\n遊戲特色：\n> 以自己的步調探索寧靜的林地。\n> 收集所有隱藏的甜瓜。\n> 探索每條小徑和隱密角落。\n> 放鬆身心，享受一場簡單溫馨的冒險。","publisher":"Downmeadowstreet","release":"2026-11-12","genres":["街機","動作","冒險","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b938c447ba532052d892d7ccf4b3e57475ac2e41cdabb77f36034e82af86dc6e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9d5335b785b9d49d417f9ba645b0f59e50dd73284217ccb461e224e6b32d74d8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1999f9446b81571ec5cb079cea342b1a11bac5993d17e7858382891d2d1d91ef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5232f6fb8ca8ca3dbf2e3d2d8beeaa382faa167d6d46d126b2415138d39d8d6b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/042efc5bf8d7401b9f1abbc2c8d8c890c58605fd167522cb9ba23cfa4b9c8364.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/656660e146a1b567f546272b391cdbd90b6bd5e5ac446dd5bbb6c4f730c795eb.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ee202a36e000","dlc":[]}